# Loyalty — Internal Batch Balance Lookup (TD31 PR5)
#
# BFF-internal, no auth guard beyond X-Internal-Key — same pattern as
# apps/backend/http/platform/internal-tenants.http's batch tenant lookup.
# Used by the BFF's CustomersController.searchCustomers() to resolve loyalty
# balances for many customers in one call instead of one call per customer.
#
# Prerequisites:
#   1. pnpm infra:up
#   2. pnpm --filter @ikaro/backend run migration:run
#   3. pnpm --filter @ikaro/backend run seed   ← populates the fixed UUIDs below
#   4. pnpm --filter @ikaro/backend run dev
#
# REST Client reads INTERNAL_API_KEY from apps/backend/.env automatically.
# Switch environment (bottom-right VS Code status bar): select "local"

@baseUrl     = {{backendUrl}}
@internalKey = {{$dotenv INTERNAL_API_KEY}}

### Batch lookup — resolve multiple customers' loyalty balances in one call
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/loyalty/balances?tenantId={{tenantId}}&customerIds={{customerId}},00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000099
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}

###

### 401 — Missing X-Internal-Key (global guard)
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/loyalty/balances?tenantId={{tenantId}}&customerIds={{customerId}}

###

### 400 — Missing tenantId query param
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/loyalty/balances?customerIds={{customerId}}
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}

###

### 400 — Missing customerIds query param
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/loyalty/balances?tenantId={{tenantId}}
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}
